@*
    MainLayout.razor
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------
    The shell every page renders inside. It answers exactly one question:
    "what appears above and below the page content?"

        Skip link  -> keyboard users jump straight to the main content
        Header     -> logo, navigation, dropdown, mobile menu
        <main>     -> the current page (LayoutComponentBase.Body)
        Footer     -> link columns, legal links, status

    Note: this layout is statically server rendered. The interactive parts
    (Header, Contact form) opt in individually with their own @rendermode,
    which keeps the rest of the page fast and simple.

    How to change something
      * Add something to every page -> add it here.
      * Add something to one page  -> put it in that page's .razor file.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>

<Header />

<main id="main-content">
    @Body
</main>

<Footer />

<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    Something went wrong. Reload the page to try again.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
    <span class="dismiss">&#215;</span>
</div>
